In Classic compute:
Server -> infra + software

infra - Azure 
Software - Databricks

In Server less compute 
infra + Software -> Databricks


Classic compute runs in cloud account like azure
Server less compute runs in databricks i.e in control plane 

Server less compute is a version less product, databricks automatically upgrades to the latest version and it always run on the latest version.

Server less has overspend protection, this controls long running queries. This helps in not to overspend.
Server less notebooks have a default execution timeout of 2.5 hours.

Currently Python & SQL are the only supported languages in Server less.



